would certainly agree that washout technology is a developing art.  I do
remember having met a lab dog at Alcor a few years ago, which didn't seem to
have any noticable cognitive deficit (for a dog), but had been severely
deafened by a high dose of an antibiotic with ototoxic side effects.  The
